WEBVTT

00:02:29.148 --> 00:02:32.386
because the natural ecosystems
are bailing us out.

00:02:33.495 --> 00:02:35.074
But don't get too comfortable,

00:02:35.995 --> 00:02:39.630
because we have two major things
working against us right now.

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:45.671
One: unless we do something big,

00:02:45.695 --> 00:02:47.614
and then fast,

00:02:47.638 --> 00:02:49.472
emissions will continue to rise.

00:02:50.511 --> 00:02:55.558
And second: the ability
of these natural ecosystems

00:02:55.582 --> 00:02:58.510
to take up carbon dioxide
from the atmosphere

00:02:58.534 --> 00:03:01.940
and sequester it in the natural habitats